## Usage instructions

- Open four seperate terminals.

- Start the server.py on one terminal and client.py on the other three terminals. (The clients can be on seperate computers)

- For each of the client terminals input the IP that the server is on.

- On the client terminals, enter in your user name for each of them.

- Once the user name has been put in for all the clients, you are able to type and communicate in the major chatroom between all of the users.

- You are able to use /w and then the username of another person to be able to communicate with them privately without the rest of the clients seeing it.